{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Demo</strong><br>The demo introduces the core mechanics through its initial puzzles, reveals the narrative hook, and immerses you in the game\u2019s atmosphere and overall vibe. <br><br><strong>About\u00a0Sophie in the Tangled World</strong><br>You\u2019ve spent your whole life moving through normal space. This game teaches you what happens when it\u2019s no longer normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769000/extras/SteamPageGIF2.gif?t=1749213306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sophie in the Tangled World</strong> is a quiet, story-driven puzzle adventure. The story follows a girl from early-19th-century Paris who slips into a strange, parallel version of her city, where the rules of familiar space no longer apply \u2014 and the only way back is to master the logic of this impossible geometry.   <br> <br><strong>What Awaits You</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Topological Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a single step and reappear in the room\u2019s far corner. Watch, experiment, and deduce the hidden laws of non-Euclidean space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Silence Instead of Tutorials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every rule you master is one you uncover yourself. No pop-ups, no glowing arrows \u2014 only time to think and the thrill of a genuine \u201caha!\u201d moment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Crafted Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each scene is filled with with period detail, while a minimalist original ambient score creates a calm, reflective mood that lets every discovery resonate.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769000?t=1749213306","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageba